excerpt: A new offtake agreement adds a steady export channel for virgin coconut oil sourced through our producer network.
coverImage: /images/news/vco-oil-supply-agreement.jpg
---

LAVS Trading has signed a new supply agreement with an industrial buyer for virgin coconut oil, adding a steady export channel for producers in its network.

Volumes, packaging, and documentation were agreed as part of the deal, with the first shipments scheduled for later this quarter. The agreement reflects growing demand from cosmetics and food & beverage buyers for traceable, Philippine-sourced VCO.
